<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css" />
</head>
<body class="auth-body">
  <main class="auth-wrap">
    <div class="auth-card">
      <div class="auth-brand">
        <span class="brand-badge">S</span>
        <div>
          <b>Sampaguita Health Clinic</b>
          <span class="muted">Patient portal</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h1 class="auth-title">Nakalimutan ang password?</h1>

      <div class="recover-steps">
        <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px">
          Ang clinic staff ang magbibigay sa iyo ng bagong password. Ganito:
        </p>
        <ol>
          <li>Pumunta sa <b>Barangay Sampaguita Health Clinic</b>.</li>
          <li>Dalhin ang <b>valid ID</b> na ginamit mo noong ginawa ang account mo.</li>
          <li>Sabihin sa staff na nakalimutan mo ang password mo sa portal.</li>
          <li>Bibigyan ka nila ng <b>bagong pansamantalang password</b> — pwede mo itong palitan
              pagkatapos mong makapasok.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:12.5px">
          Sa clinic lang ito ginagawa dahil kailangang makita ng staff ang ID mo bago ibigay ang
          bagong password. Ito ang pumipigil na may ibang tao ang makapasok sa records mo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="auth-links" style="margin-top:18px">
        <a href="/portal/login">← Balik sa sign in</a>
      </div>

      <p class="auth-foot muted">Your health records are private · RA 10173 protected</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
